The '''Tarantula Beast''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} that spawns rarely when a player doing the [[Tarantula Broodfather]] {{SlayerTier|IV}} quest kills a [[Spider]]. When this happens, an explosion effect takes place and the Tarantula Beast spawns.

